<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Warp Mania - Support</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background: #111827;
            color: white;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 650px;
            width: 100%;
            background: #1f2937;
            padding: 50px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
            text-align: center;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #3bb9ff;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-size: 2.2rem;
        }

        h2 {
            font-weight: normal;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        p {
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            color: #e5e7eb;
        }

        a {
            color: #4fc3ff;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .email {
            margin: 30px 0;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            font-size: .9rem;
            color: #9ca3af;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <h1>Warp Mania</h1>
    <h2>Support</h2>

    <p>
        If you experience any issue with Warp Mania or have any questions,
        suggestions or feedback, please contact us by email.
    </p>

    <div class="email">
        📧<br><br>
        <a href="mailto:contact@DNA-Games-Studio.com">
            contact@DNA-Games-Studio.com
        </a>
    </div>

    <p>
        We will do our best to respond as quickly as possible.
    </p>

    <div class="footer">
        © 2026 DNA Games Studio
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
